XXRF Viewer Portable Bundle
===========================

Contents
--------
- xxrf_viewer.exe
- runtime DLL dependencies copied from the current MSYS2/UCRT64 toolchain
- assets/ with viewer fonts

Notes
-----
- This bundle is expected to be run on Windows x86_64.
- If HackRF devices are not detected, the usual cause is the Windows USB driver setup rather than the application bundle itself.
- The viewer expects the assets directory to stay next to the executable.

Tested layout
-------------
xxrf_viewer-win64/
  xxrf_viewer.exe
  *.dll
  assets/

Build origin
------------
Generated from the xxrf CMake target `xxrf_bundle_viewer`.
